  "text": "I was feeling extremely air hungry, couldn�\nt get enough in to get over a hump (hard to describe) and feel relieved\n; SEVERE headaches and neck muscle tightness/spasms; walking just a few feet made me feel exhausted and out of breath; arrhythmia; tachcardia; hypotension and hypertension; nasty malaise; I was convinced I was going to die; worst depression and anxiety I have had for years and also started to have full-on panic attacks; thoughts of not wanting to continue like this; sickest\nI have ever been and I have a chronic debilitating illness; each day was just trudging through and very dark; no motivation, no energy, no mental clarity.\nI was taking Pepsid for over a month for sour stomach at night.\nI don�t sleep as it is\nand this was makinng it more difficult.\nI had no idea that Pepsid could cause these side effects and figured my chronic illness was progressing very raoidly and this was my fate.\nThe headaches and neck spasms had me crying from the pain.\nSeemed to get worse after dinner time even though that was\na couple hours before I took Pepsid.\nBeen off for a couple days now and\nit�s starting to look like thing are just starting to improve.\nCan trace back these symptoms to within a couple of days of starting Pepsid.\nI�\nm still very scared that this may be permanent\nbut I am trying to remind myself of how many people here had the same side-effects as me and it got better for them.\nI will be going back to my Iberogast for any tummy troubles and never use a H2 antihistamine type of acid reducer ever again.\n",
